=== REASONING ===
Widget layout: follows LifetimeStatsWidget pattern closely (WidgetStatGrid, compact/standard/wide branching).
6 core stat cards: Total Miles, Total Drives, Energy Used, CO₂ Saved, Best Month, Longest Drive.
2 wide-only cards: Driving Time (hours), Top Speed.
Compact: single AnimatedNumber showing total distance for the year.
Unit conversions: convertDistance for distance (km→mi→user), convertSpeed for top speed.
Busiest month derived from monthly_stats by highest drive count.
All strings use t() with dashboard namespace. Null-safe throughout.

